{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/373672-lunar-hero-style-hero-enhancement-deprivation","id":373672,"title":"Lunar Hero Style: Hero Enhancement Deprivation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-17T12:32:02-08:00","id":373672,"title":"Lunar Hero Style: Hero Enhancement Deprivation","content":"One thing that always aggravated me was how Lunars were near to completely shafted in just about every department, from vision, charms, and general mechanics. Lunar Hero style lacking Enhancement bonuses for Lunars using the style is just one of these things. But still I'd like to hope, does anybody have any idea if there was any sort of Hero enhancement bonuses for Lunar hero style and if not, what sort of bonuses should be existing?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/839-justacritic","name":"justacritic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T12:46:59-08:00","id":373695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>justacritic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/373672-lunar-hero-style-hero-enhancement-deprivation#post373672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing that always aggravated me was how Lunars were near to completely shafted in just about every department...</div> </div> </div> </div>Pffft... your longing is nothing as compared to Sunder's. The <i>gravitational</i> longing for something related to lunars to be OK whether that be the fundamental nature of Lunars, the way that the selection of Moonsilver Caste alchemical reflects on Creation-born Lunars, the Thousand Streams River and Ten-Stripes in particular being deliberately written so as to cast Lunars in the worst light possible ...<br /> <br /> Once upon a time I coined (at least in my area) the term Sun-Blind for someone who had drunk the kool-aid and fully bought on to the 'Only Solars Could Possibly Be As Awesome As Solars Are' but I could honestly not gather the words to describe the depth and breadth of Sunder's investment to the concept from the very beginning. I don't even slightly agree with a lot of the things he puts forward, but if we could grasp his passion for Lunars as a power source the global warming could bite our (his!) ass.<br /> <br /> I long for the day new Lunars comes out and blows Sunder away becuse ... damn ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T14:15:07-08:00","id":373763,"title":"","content":"For a moment I forgot Inugami's new username so I thought you were a) doing some weird contraction of yours &quot;sudden...thunder... <i>sunder</i>&quot; and b) referring to yourself in the third person.<br /> <br /> The obvious answer to OP would be some kind of bonus to mauling someone in animal form; perhaps take the human form as a baseline, then larger forms do more damage but smaller ones are harder to shake off. Of course, I can't speak to 3ex Lunars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T14:27:05-08:00","id":373791,"title":"","content":"The best way to improve Lunar Hero Style is to not have Lunar Hero Style. Lunars shouldn't have a Martial Arts-type tree that other people can arguably learn more easily, and without being nearly as gifted in natural capabilities. That's just plain crazy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T14:32:36-08:00","id":373797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/373672-lunar-hero-style-hero-enhancement-deprivation?p=373763#post373763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For a moment I forgot Inugami's new username so I thought you were a) doing some weird contraction of yours &quot;sudden...thunder... <i>sunder</i>&quot; and b) referring to yourself in the third person.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha! The so-geeky-it's-sad thing is that 'Sudden Thunder' was a character I played in a game where we tossed about some made up Old Realm. So there is absolutely a wierd, made up, talking-about-yourself-in-the-third-person name i could be using, but no-one would have a damn what I'm talking about. <br /> <br /> (I took Thunder's name because my prior handle is now illegal on the forum. Understood, but sad.)<br /> <br /> It's also a bit funny because I mostly think of Sunder as TornadoWolf, whom he wore when we most crossed verbs and nouns. My Second Edition lull seems to have made Inugami a face I largely past by. <br /> <br /> (And also because Shin Megami Tensei. You always want Inugami on your side, until the named enemies become available ...)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T14:54:13-08:00","id":373808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuddenThunder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/373672-lunar-hero-style-hero-enhancement-deprivation?p=373695#post373695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pffft... your longing is nothing as compared to Sunder's. The <i>gravitational</i> longing for something related to lunars to be OK whether that be the fundamental nature of Lunars, the way that the selection of Moonsilver Caste alchemical reflects on Creation-born Lunars, the Thousand Streams River and Ten-Stripes in particular being deliberately written so as to cast Lunars in the worst light possible ...<br /> <br /> Once upon a time I coined (at least in my area) the term Sun-Blind for someone who had drunk the kool-aid and fully bought on to the 'Only Solars Could Possibly Be As Awesome As Solars Are' but I could honestly not gather the words to describe the depth and breadth of Sunder's investment to the concept from the very beginning. I don't even slightly agree with a lot of the things he puts forward, but if we could grasp his passion for Lunars as a power source the global warming could bite our (his!) ass.</div> </div> </div> </div>Brother, you ain't kidding.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I long for the day new Lunars comes out and blows Sunder away becuse ... damn ... </div> </div> </div>Wait, what name am I wearing?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4762-t0rnad0-w0lf","name":"T0RNAD0 W0LF","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T15:03:04-08:00","id":373815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>T0RNAD0 W0LF</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/373672-lunar-hero-style-hero-enhancement-deprivation?p=373808#post373808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, what name am I wearing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh my God, that's the cute little puppy that always made me think of Amaterasu from Okami. Love it.<br /> <br /> That said, if you're not Sunder then very uncool ...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1849-suddenthunder","name":"SuddenThunder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1849_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T15:05:23-08:00","id":373841,"title":"","content":"Holy crap, I just had a sudden throwback.<br /> <br /> You fools! You invoked my previous incarnation! He howls at the door, now...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T18:34:13-08:00","id":373955,"title":"","content":"Weird.<br /> <br /> This is all weird.<br /> <br /> You're all weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T20:42:57-08:00","id":374026,"title":"","content":"Lunar Hero style has no enhancement bonuses because no-one ever takes it anyway, so when they were doing 2.5 and gave some styles enhancement bonuses to a few (by which I mean, like, maybe 2?) hero styles, they didn't care enough to do it.<br /> Which is fair, honestly, it'd need a lot more than a couple of enhancement bonuses to fix.<br /> If you're a Lunar and you want to learn martial arts, go learn an animal style. If there's any Martial Arts styles Lunars are good at, it should be animal style (who's better at emulating animals than Lunars?) not a random collection of vague weak charms with little connection to the rest of the charmset (oh, and one really good charm).<br /> I've not only never seen a Lunar player take Lunar Hero style, I've never seen a Lunar player express interest in Lunar Hero style.<br /> (Actually, thinking about it, I think the only Lunar martial artist I've ever seen was a Tiger-totem Lunar who used Tiger style. I've seen plenty of characters who used the MA ability to punch things, or claw things, but they generally stuck to silver claws and regeneration rather than kung fu charms. There's a couple of Lunars I saw who began learning a few basic martial arts charms near the end of a campaign, but rarely used them. Unlike Solars, who I've seen a ton of different styles from, even though ironically those styles are weaker than their own charms.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 01-17-2015, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T21:05:17-08:00","id":374035,"title":"","content":"Infernal Monster don't get Enhancement either, so it's not like Lunar is being singled out or anything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T21:31:14-08:00","id":374044,"title":"","content":"Neither does Terrestrial Hero Style.<br /> So... I think it might literally just be Solar Hero Style. I think it was an idea that they had which they considered having in all the splats, but never got round to.<br /> And since in 3rd ed, the Hero styles are gone (or rather, back to Brawl charms) they presumably won't be back.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T21:37:23-08:00","id":374045,"title":"","content":"Do I have notes on this? I'll check and see if I have notes on this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T21:43:53-08:00","id":374047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/373672-lunar-hero-style-hero-enhancement-deprivation?p=374045#post374045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do I have notes on this? I'll check and see if I have notes on this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like to imagine Vance sitting in his room with a wall full of notes that would solve every single problem in 2e...but the pattern is so complex that the notes become lost the moment they get pined up on the wall...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://asheathersworldturns.files.wordpress.com/2014/05/spider-man-conspiracy-map.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\