2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T23:59:40-08:00","id":374094,"title":"","content":"Lunar Hero isn't worth saving.<br /> <br /> Most of the worthwhile Charms already existed in First Edition. Terrible Wolverine Onslaught could be worthwhile, if it's not made to directly synergize with a Charm that wasn't actually written functionally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}